  "post_title": "Vicente Seguí y la SAMVO tributarán a Nino Bravo el 23 de octubre en el Mónaco de Onda",
  "post_date": "2016-08-19 13:12:58",
  "post_name": "vicente-segui-y-la-samvo-tributaran-a-nino-bravo-el-9-doctubre-en-el-monaco-de-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_7284.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El &#39;triunfito&#39; valenciano Vicente Segu&iacute; junto a la orquesta sinf&oacute;nica de la Societat Art&iacute;stico-Musical Vila d&#39;Onda (SAMVO), reforzada hasta unos 60 m&uacute;sicos como en el concierto de Raphael, rendir&aacute;n tributo al fallecido Nino Bravo en el Teatro M&oacute;naco, el 23 de octubre a las 23 horas, con entrada gratuita.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_9544.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Aunque el propio cantante valenciano anunci&oacute; que ser&iacute;a el 9 d&#39;Octubre durante la actuaci&oacute;n que realiz&oacute; en las fiestas del Arrabal del Castillo el jueves 21 de julio (23 fotos de la misma, m&aacute;s una de la SAMVO en el M&oacute;naco, de archivo), <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/VicenteSegui/photos/a.147459477754.136664.58581202754/10154516087882755/?type=3\" target=\"_blank\">finalmente el concierto Nino Sinf&oacute;nico ha cambiado al primer domingo de Fira d&#39;Onda por la noche</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9519.jpg\" alt=\"img_9519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9521.jpg\" alt=\"img_9521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9522.jpg\" alt=\"img_9522\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9523.jpg\" alt=\"img_9523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9524.jpg\" alt=\"img_9524\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9525.jpg\" alt=\"img_9525\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9526.jpg\" alt=\"img_9526\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9527.jpg\" alt=\"img_9527\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9528.jpg\" alt=\"img_9528\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9530.jpg\" alt=\"img_9530\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9531.jpg\" alt=\"img_9531\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9533.jpg\" alt=\"img_9533\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9534.jpg\" alt=\"img_9534\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9535.jpg\" alt=\"img_9535\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9536.jpg\" alt=\"img_9536\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9537.jpg\" alt=\"img_9537\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9538.jpg\" alt=\"img_9538\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9539.jpg\" alt=\"img_9539\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9540.jpg\" alt=\"img_9540\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9541.jpg\" alt=\"img_9541\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9542.jpg\" alt=\"img_9542\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9543.jpg\" alt=\"img_9543\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_9544.jpg\" alt=\"img_9544\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vicenteseguiravalcastellonda/img_7284.jpg\" alt=\"img_7284\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
